{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/about/layout,_N_T_/about/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/about/[slug]/page,_N_T_/about/2026-01-03-to-the-god-of-instant-noodles"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/about/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/about/$d$slug","/about","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--Q5K0UX1dTfp8SZPg_L6Wj--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.15008bfb.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.3a6ba036.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/330a17ddee87f907.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/20d1a56625def336.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/806bdb8e4a6a9b95.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3a7ba59533961d35.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d702a24e2b6c48fa.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-53420ca41719f304.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/7c92e96509cd355e.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Personal Portfolio</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Crafting code, capturing light, and making some noise.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0b3bf435.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_5901b7c6-module__ec5Qua__variable jetbrains_mono_8be3b53a-module__CxiPNW__variable antialiased relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 pointer-events-none grainy opacity-20\"></div><main class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#060606] text-neutral-400 font-light selection:bg-white selection:text-black pb-32\"><header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 p-6 grid grid-cols-3 items-center bg-[#060606]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-neutral-900/50\"><div class=\"flex justify-start\"><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 font-sans transition-colors duration-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-white\"><span class=\"mr-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">[</span><span class=\"tracking-widest uppercase\">&lt; Back</span><span class=\"ml-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">]</span></span></a></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><h1 class=\"text-[10px] md:text-xs font-normal tracking-[0.4em] text-neutral-500 uppercase\">Monologue</h1></div><div class=\"flex justify-end invisible md:visible\"><div class=\"w-16\"></div></div></header><main class=\"pt-48 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><header class=\"mb-24 space-y-8\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">JANUARY 2, 2026</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light tracking-tight text-neutral-100 leading-tight uppercase\">To the God of Instant Noodles</h1><div class=\"w-12 h-px bg-neutral-800\"></div></header><article class=\"prose prose-invert max-w-none\"><div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light space-y-12 whitespace-pre-wrap\">I just whipped up a bowl of Buldak noodles,\n\nWhen a friend sent over a photo—\n\nA plate of crawfish we once shared.\n\nWhat defines a &quot;crawfish&quot; now?\n\nI’ve long lost the answer.\n\nBut then again,\n\nWhat do Buldak noodles have to do with fire turkeys?\n\nI suppose we’ll never know.\n\nI’ve forgotten what summer even looks like.\n\nStaring at the heavy snow outside, I can’t help but sigh.\n\nIf I were to leap,\n\nWould it be the Past or the Present that kills me?\n\nThe Past has already happened, and the Present stands idly by.\n\nBy process of elimination, only the Future remains.\n\nBut the Future, armed with a perfect alibi,\n\nStruts around with arrogant impunity.\n\nSo, what kills me\n\nIs the absence of a future.\n\nBut oh, merciful God of Instant Noodles,\n\nI once swore to You—\n\nI would remain forever loyal to Shin Ramyun,\n\nNever reaching my greedy hands toward the Buldak cult.\n\nYet here I am, standing in utter solitude,\n\nPersonally slaughtering my own vow.\n\nJust as I once told my mother\n\nI would never smoke.\n\nNow I realize\n\nThat &quot;forever&quot; arrives much sooner than expected.\n\nBut oh, kind God of Instant Noodles,\n\nDo You still remember?\n\nWe once fought side by side,\n\nDespising the disciples of Buldak,\n\nDeeming that filthy cuisine the darkest of heresies.\n\nBut I—but I—\n\nAt some untraceable moment,\n\nStopped feeling Your presence.\n\nI curled up in a field of black rye,\n\nLetting it swallow me whole.\n\nThat was the first time I cried with such stillness.\n\nAre You still there, my Lord?\n\nI choose to believe\n\nThat the snow outside\n\nIs the penance You have cast down.\n\nI kneel in Your boundless white, sobbing, confessing.\n\nBut oh, heartless God of Instant Noodles,\n\nI cannot decipher Your oracles.\n\nI don&#x27;t understand why You left,\n\nAbandoning me to this bitter winter,\n\nLetting the frost pierce through my ribs.\n\nIn my moment of deepest despair,\n\nIt was the Buldak noodles\n\nThat took me into their embrace.\n\nBuldak noodles are tasty,\n\nBut I don&#x27;t like Buldak noodles.\n\nYou know this.\n\nBut I had no choice.\n\nBetween eternal darkness and total depravity,\n\nI simply chose to survive.\n\nBut if—just if—\n\nYou ever descend upon this wasteland again,\n\nRemember that field of black rye I told You about.\n\nErect a headstone for me.\n\nOffer a pack of Shin Ramyun,\n\nAnd perhaps a Matcha Latte,\n\nTo mourn me, and Your former glory.</div></article><footer class=\"mt-32 pt-16 border-t border-neutral-900 flex justify-end items-center\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-700 tracking-widest uppercase\">End of Passage</div></footer></main></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/20d1a56625def336.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n6:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n8:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[68027,[],\\\"default\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/330a17ddee87f907.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.15008bfb.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.3a6ba036.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"Q5K0UX1dTfp8SZPg-L6Wj\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"about\\\",\\\"2026-01-03-to-the-god-of-instant-noodles\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":