e snow outside\n\nIs the penance You have cast down.\n\nI kneel in Your boundless white, sobbing, confessing.\n\nBut oh, heartless God of Instant Noodles,\n\nI cannot decipher Your oracles.\n\nI don't understand why You left,\n\nAbandoning me to this bitter winter,\n\nLetting the frost pierce through my ribs.\n\nIn my moment of deepest despair,\n\nIt was the Buldak noodles\n\nThat took me into their embrace.\n\nBuldak noodles are tasty,\n\nBut I don't like Buldak noodles.\n\nYou know this.\n\nBut I had no choice.\n\nBetween eternal darkness and total depravity,\n\nI simply chose to survive.\n\nBut if—just if—\n\nYou ever descend upon this wasteland again,\n\nRemember that field of black rye I told You about.\n\nErect a headstone for me.\n\nOffer a pack of Shin Ramyun,\n\nAnd perhaps a Matcha Latte,\n\nTo mourn me, and Your former glory.4:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-[#060606] text-neutral-400 font-light selection:bg-white selection:text-black pb-32\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 p-6 grid grid-cols-3 items-center bg-[#060606]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-neutral-900/50\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"href\":\"/about\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 font-sans transition-colors duration-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-white\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mr-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\",\"children\":\"[\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"tracking-widest uppercase\",\"children\":\"< Back\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\",\"children\":\"]\"}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[10px] md:text-xs font-normal tr